<title>JAPAN: Sapporo Lion - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sapporo Lion - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 14.57		vs	   14.41</p>
<p> Operating	  223    million    vs	  389    million</p>
<p> Current	    262    million    vs	  444    million</p>
<p> Net		  109    million    vs	  196    million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.59 yen	  vs	   13.63 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sapporo Lion Ltd is the largest beer restaurant chain operator.</p>
</text>
